WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:09.134 --> 00:00:11.011
A suit doesn't make a man.

00:00:15.682 --> 00:00:17.225
It's what's inside the suit that counts.

00:00:20.770 --> 00:00:22.230
It's resourcefulness...

00:00:23.815 --> 00:00:25.442
and perhaps an open heart.

00:00:28.445 --> 00:00:30.280
Well, what are you waiting for?

00:00:31.448 --> 00:00:32.824
I haven't finished my drink.

00:00:36.536 --> 00:00:38.121
This sacred institution

00:00:39.164 --> 00:00:41.291
wields power beyond your imagination.

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:44.669
Winston, your brother

00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:45.754
stole something from me.

00:00:52.427 --> 00:00:54.095
What he took is very important

00:00:54.095 --> 00:00:56.222
to a lot of very dangerous people.

00:00:58.349 --> 00:00:58.725
Find him.

00:00:58.850 --> 00:00:59.684
Because if you don't,

00:00:59.684 --> 00:01:00.643
I'll bring the weight of this

00:01:00.643 --> 00:01:02.437
whole institution down on you both.

00:01:03.772 --> 00:01:04.898
Charon.

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.274
Show our guest the door.

00:01:08.902 --> 00:01:10.320
You made a big mistake coming here.

00:01:10.612 --> 00:01:11.821
You're my brother, Frankie.

00:01:12.655 --> 00:01:13.698
We have to strike first.

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:15.909
And I need all the help

00:01:15.909 --> 00:01:16.576
I can get.

00:01:17.160 --> 00:01:18.870
How are we supposed to believe a guy 

00:01:18.870 --> 00:01:20.830
in an ascot can pull this off?

00:01:22.957 --> 00:01:23.875
It's a cravat.

00:01:26.795 --> 00:01:28.004
If we're gonna take on The Continental,

00:01:31.382 --> 00:01:33.510
every freak in that hotel will be after us.

00:01:36.930 --> 00:01:37.722
Well, that's lovely.

00:01:42.393 --> 00:01:43.561
We need guns.

00:01:44.521 --> 00:01:45.688
Lots of guns.

00:02:00.954 --> 00:02:02.497
This is more than vengeance.

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:04.165
This is justice.

00:02:08.169 --> 00:02:08.920
Can you dig it?

00:02:08.920 --> 00:02:09.796
Shhh...

00:02:13.591 --> 00:02:14.759
Let's take this house,

00:02:15.885 --> 00:02:17.804
and everything that comes with it.

00:02:26.062 --> 00:02:27.355
And away we go.

